==Battleground==
*1 [[Dagshund]] spawns after 1.67 seconds<sup>50f</sup>.
*6 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[Shadow Boxer K]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Bun Bun Black]] spawns as the boss.
**20 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
**3 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**5 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**5 [[Wall Doge]]s spawn, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
**5 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**5 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**5 [[Wall Doge]]s spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**2 [[Mr. Mole]]s spawn, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Bring [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]] or any other anti-Dark units to deal with the Bun Bun Black and the Shadow Boxer Ks. [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]]/[[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman Cat]] is also a solid choice here, being able to do much damage to the Dagshunds and the Bun Bun Black. Sooner or later, the Bun Bun Black will die, and you can rush the rest of the stage easily.

==Trivia==
*Along with [[An Hour's Training (Insane)|Shack of Spirit]] and [[A Month's Training (Deadly)|Cave of Spirit]], this stage is a reference to the [[wikia:dragonball:Hyperbolic Time Chamber|Room of Spirit and Time]] from ''Dragon Ball''.

